OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome readers may find this article
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FA teacher in the US state of Oregon
OL,11,Ftackled a teenager who entered her
OL,12,Fclassroom during a school shooting and
OL,13,Fattempted to disarm him, police have
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe teacher, who has not been named,
OL,17,Fthrew her mobile phone before trying to
OL,18,Fwrestle a shotgun off the 16-year-old
OL,19,Fon the floor of a classroom where three
OL,20,Fchildren and a teacher were killed on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
