OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA father of two girls at the Silver
OL,8,FRail Elementary in Bend armed with a
OL,9,Fpistol then ran inside and killed the
OL,10,Fshooter after driving past special
OL,11,Feducational needs school and saw the
OL,12,Fattack unfolding, police revealed in a
OL,13,Fnews conference on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
